Roxanne II decrypting centre
Message 31130
For % &

Here Alex Kolman.

I arrived at Tagada this morning to give you a helping hand.
The Tagada Golf course is a real jewel and I intend to defend
this field right to the end. You will take command of the
Morita base. We are at the Lendo borders, our enemies have
three supplies bases here that are very well defended.

Here are my instructions :

To the West of Morita you have General Gabor, he's a real
brute, take care of him as quickly as possible or else you're
dead.

I will see to getting rid of Colonel Sweg, in the North West,
nicknamed the butcher.

The person that risks causing us problems is the Admiral
Nutko, he holds the base on the island of Honto to the east
of your coasts. He is vicious, his chemical arms are a
horror and he collects massacres. We will need to visit him
quickly as soon as we have destroyed our primary targets.

Actually, do you know how to play golf ? If so, rendez-vous
at Tagada for a short round.